# The source the per-flavour tocs are generated from -- one today,
# Manners_Camelot.toc -- and the fallback the game reads on any client that does
# not honour a suffixed name. Edit this one; run `python tools/maketocs.py` and
# the generated toc follows. tests/validate.py fails if they have drifted.
#
# The interface is a single number, 16001, because 1.0 ships for WoW Forever
# alone. It is the one client anybody here can test, and the number is the one
# that shipped and is known to work there.
## Interface: 16001, 11509, 20506, 50504, 120100
## Title: Manners
## Notes: One click to buff back whoever just buffed you, and nearby players missing yours.
## Notes-deDE: Ein Klick erwidert den Gefallen, wenn Euch gerade jemand gestärkt hat, und stärkt Spieler in der Nähe, denen Euer Stärkungszauber fehlt.
## Notes-esES: Un clic para devolver el beneficio a quien acaba de darte uno, y para dar el tuyo a los jugadores cercanos que no lo tienen.
## Notes-esMX: Un clic para devolver el beneficio a quien acaba de darte uno, y para dar el tuyo a los jugadores cercanos que no lo tienen.
## Notes-frFR: Un clic pour rendre la politesse à qui vient de vous buffer, et pour buffer les joueurs proches à qui manque votre amélioration.
## Notes-itIT: Un clic per ricambiare chi ti ha appena dato un beneficio, e per dare il tuo ai giocatori vicini a cui manca.
## Notes-koKR: 클릭 한 번으로, 방금 나에게 버프를 준 사람에게는 버프로 보답하고 내 버프가 없는 주변 플레이어에게는 버프를 줍니다.
## Notes-ptBR: Um clique para devolver o bônus a quem acabou de dar um a você, e para dar o seu aos jogadores por perto que estão sem ele.
## Notes-zhCN: 一键给刚为你加过增益的人回一个，也给附近缺少你增益的玩家补上。
## Notes-zhTW: 一鍵為剛替你加增益的人加回去，也為附近缺少你增益的玩家加上。
